// Continental seed 101, 2 AIs, start epoch 9 (World War I, base ini start_epoch=9): P2 base ~80,52, P3 base ~38,38.
// Bombing: at minute 19.5 P2 gets an airport (66) at 92,56, at 20 25 aircraft of type 71 (the player's 25 on the reference save; 72 is a fighter: it hits aircraft only) and 4 bombers (79: 135 a hit, area 1.5); every
// 20 s they attack whatever of P3's is nearest to them within 15 tiles of 40,40 (stats engage ... T tx ty) - they go
// back to the airport to refuel on their own. Does AA built ahead (aa_ahead) save P3's town? Measure P3's buildings
// lost, losses, workers, and the aircraft left.

defence(2, 0)
wait_until(19.5min)
spawn(2, unit.b_airport, 92, 56, 1)
wait_until(20min)
spawn(2, unit.a_strafe_fighter10_fokker_dr_1, 92, 60, 25)
spawn(2, unit.a_bomber_11_b_17, 94, 62, 4)
every(0.33min, 20.10min, 33.96min, (run) => {
    stats("engage", 2, 92, 58, 60, unit.a_strafe_fighter10_fokker_dr_1, 40, 40)
    stats("engage", 2, 92, 58, 60, unit.a_bomber_11_b_17, 40, 40)
})
